'''Bayou Sludge''' is an {{Rarity|e|nolink=y}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up from water in the {{zone|Backwater Bayou}}.

== Spawning ==
'''Bayou Sludge''' can be fished up from water in the {{zone|Backwater Bayou}}. It requires {{skl|fishing|15}} or higher to be fished up.

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for '''Bayou Sludge''' is {{Green|500}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|5.00%|1|20|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Currently there are no modifiers that can be used to increase it.
